Traffic Advisory: Updates on Fifth Ave where traffic is down to three lines between Bigelow & Craft... ICYMI, all vehicles can now use the old contraflow bus lane to head westbound through the Oakland business district during current construction planned through end of April. Additional construction near Chestferfield is further tightening Fifth Avenue down to two lanes  as vehicles approach Craft Ave.

@PGHtransit PRT work zones related to the University Line bus rapid transit project are located on Fifth between Bellefield/Robinson, Fifth between Robinson/Wyandotte, and Forbes between Jumonville/Birmingham Bridge.

Details about the impacts can be found in our latest traffic advisory here https://t.co/gkvYpch4KY
